-- Synthetic M5 seed corpus (plan §5): 3 matches x 8 players x 24 rounds.
-- Generated by ref-free formulas (see internal/metrics fixture tests);
-- small enough to eyeball the key aggregates:
--   events            : 3 * 24 * (5 kill + 20 damage + 2 blind) = 1944 rows
--   kill headshots    : i%2==0  -> 3/5 per round, ratio 0.6 exactly
--   flash-assisted    : i%3==0  -> P1/P4/P5/P8 = 36 kills each (library)
--   player_round_stats: dies when r%4 == idx%4 (6 deaths/player/match),
--                       traded iff died and r <= 12 -> 3 untraded/match
--   round_economy     : equip 2500 ct / 2000 t every round -> avg 2250,
--                       sum/rounds = 4500
--   rounds            : winner ct on odd r -> CT win rate 0.5
--   engagements       : 1 opening + 1 trade + 1 untraded per round,
--                       opening won_by ct on odd r -> 0.5
